<tr><td colspan=2>Greetings Bloodhorde, <br>
<br>
*Smirks devilishly as he scans your faces, right hand resting on the pommel of the biggest Dagger you have ever seen*  I address you today to deliver a warning; I now weild a weapon of Epic proportions, be wary of me. Take great care to not raise my ire, for death will be even swifter than before. *Glares threateningly at the crowd one last time, then saunters away*<br>
<br>
(ooc) Heya folks  =)   I wanted to post here to thank all the folks who helped me along in my quest. It took me months of RL time to complete, as well as many deaths. My deaths and those of many others. Gneil I appreciate your post, but felt I should start a thread of my own for this purpose =)  For those of you who are curious as to what I went to such great lenghts to get, I will tell you.  Ragebringer  15/25 Piercing  STR+20  DEX/AGI/STA +10  HP+100  DR/PR+10  MR+20  Effect: Seething Fury (40% Haste and +40 Attack).  Well worth my trouble I think  >=)  Oh, and another tidbit for those who are curious, my backstabs  went from 200 avg, 260's max (With a Trak's Tooth; 10/20 ) to 350 avg. to 430's max.   I love this thing!  hahaha *Looks around for something to Poke*  Anyway, I am very happy with mine, and will be more than happy to use it to help any of you get yours.<br>
<br>
Voness Dyr'Fate<br>
Circle of Bones<br>
The Shadow that might be behind you.  >=)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=2>&nbsp;</td></tr>

